## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design a scalable, privacy-conscious ML system with strict latency. Requires blending edge and cloud inference, robust evaluation, and deployment guardrails.

## Key Concepts

- Hybrid inference (edge + server)
- Latency budgeting and profiling
- Privacy-preserving learning and personalization
- Concept drift detection and controlled rollout

## Code Example

