## Why This Is Asked

Tests system design under privacy, latency, and drift with multimodal data.

## Key Concepts
- Multimodal fusion
- Streaming data pipelines
- Drift detection and adaptive retraining
- Privacy: DP/FL, data minimization
- Low-latency serving and quantization

## Code Example
